      "purpose": "Defines server-side authorization for file-room records, enforcing note attribution and comment authorship against authenticated session metadata.",
      "summary": "This module combines shared comment, thread, and reaction authorizers with a custom shape authorizer for notes. It permits deletions, preserves unchanged note attribution during updates, and accepts only null or the current session user when attribution changes. Non-note shapes bypass attribution checks, while forged note creates or attribution changes are rejected by returning null.",
